WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.867 --> 00:00:02.101
-We are in the Doombox.

00:00:02.101 --> 00:00:05.404
Our next three songs
will decide

00:00:05.404 --> 00:00:06.572
tonight's champions.

00:00:06.572 --> 00:00:09.242
It's time for
Slay It, Don't Spray it.

00:00:09.242 --> 00:00:11.443
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:11.443 --> 00:00:15.014
-♪ I know the words
are new this way ♪

00:00:15.014 --> 00:00:16.549
-Now, here's how this works.

00:00:16.549 --> 00:00:18.084 line:0%
Players from each team
will take turns

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:20.820 line:0%
singing well known songs,
karaoke style.

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:22.388 line:0%
They'll have the lyrics
in front of them,

00:00:22.388 --> 00:00:23.690
but when the music drops out,

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:25.558
they'll have to finish
the line from memory

00:00:25.558 --> 00:00:27.760
If they don't get the lyrics
exactly right,

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:31.030
the microphones in front of them
will spray water in their face.

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:34.534
But if they can slay it and sing
all of the words perfectly,

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:37.436
then their opponents
get drenched instead.

00:00:37.436 --> 00:00:40.240
Each song
is worth 50,000 points,

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:42.742
so it's still anyone's game.

00:00:42.742 --> 00:00:47.213
Alright, Halle, Simu,
your team is up first.

00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:48.581
Let's see what song you get.

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:50.950 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:53.986 --> 00:00:55.988 line:0%
"Poker Face," Lady Gaga.

00:00:55.988 --> 00:00:58.324
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:58.324 --> 00:01:01.627
Now you have to decide
who's going to sing this one.

00:01:01.627 --> 00:01:03.296
Do you know it?
Who knows "Poker Face."

00:01:03.296 --> 00:01:04.730
-I think you should sing it.

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:06.165
-I will do it, Jimmy.

00:01:06.165 --> 00:01:08.968
-You're going to go?
Alright.

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:11.537
-Okay, whenever you're ready,
